('<h2>2. &#191;Es 0.1 lo mismo que 0.10 y 0.100?</h2>', '<h2>2. Is 0.1 the same as 0.10 and 0.100?</h2>'),
('<p>Muchas personas creen que 0.10 es &#8220;mayor&#8221; o &#8220;distinto&#8221; que 0.1 porque tiene m&#225;s cifras. Observe el punto naranja: al a&#241;adir ceros, la regla se afina, pero el punto no se mueve ni un pelo.</p>', '<p>Many people think 0.10 is &#8220;greater than&#8221; or &#8220;different from&#8221; 0.1 because it has more digits. Watch the orange point: when you add zeros, the ruler gets finer, but the point does not move at all.</p>'),
